{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/209663da358bfcab3838e945f273b5a6.avif?t=1761866399\" width=600 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/425a82cb47e5025ed2d1de3369b78c2b.poster.avif?t=1761866399\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/425a82cb47e5025ed2d1de3369b78c2b.webm?t=1761866399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/425a82cb47e5025ed2d1de3369b78c2b.mp4?t=1761866399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re a contract runner for <strong>Backrooms Union</strong>. Pick a level\u2014Level 0\u2019s endless yellow walls, the damp Boiler Tunnels, the humming Poolrooms, and more\u2014then head inside to <strong>collect scrap</strong> for the Union\u2019s bottom line. Haul enough before shift\u2019s end or management \u201crestructures\u201d you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/1ae442c3cf9dd71fb210e3892f927518.avif?t=1761866399\" width=600 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/191c593a4e79d0e3091b243f33e99213.poster.avif?t=1761866399\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/191c593a4e79d0e3091b243f33e99213.webm?t=1761866399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level crawls with <strong>Backrooms entities</strong> that stalk noise, light, or the scent of fear. Go in solo for the full panic, or bring a squad and cover each other with call-outs and walkie talkies. Staying together is your best insurance policy\u2014sometimes your only one.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/5bcce1f194d47f7d48fe4561bc38addb.avif?t=1761866399\" width=600 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/f170585d70a0ab73dd4a7bbd26a5e051.poster.avif?t=1761866399\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/f170585d70a0ab73dd4a7bbd26a5e051.webm?t=1761866399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/f170585d70a0ab73dd4a7bbd26a5e051.mp4?t=1761866399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn today\u2019s hazard pay into tomorrow\u2019s edge: tougher suits, brighter lamps, faster feet\u2014whatever helps you dive deeper and drag more junk out alive. Better gear means bigger quotas, but the Union never stops raising the bar.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816820/extras/4e47a73e8908001b18c63b10c5621d7f.avif?t=1761866399\" width=600 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.ste